    "description": "**Goal:** Map the signup-to-Salesforce path end to end and confirm the final API endpoint / SF intake process, with real examples.\n\n**To cover:**\n\n* Agency branded websites / API / Betlab: what's on each signup form, who gets access, when do they fill it out\n* Whether the form captures enough to create a \"Sign-Up\" record directly in Salesforce\n* How signup links are generated and how they tie to affiliate links\n* Click-to-lead auto-capture: the mechanism for creating a real-time lead on click (core to closing the manual-log gap)\n* Endpoint specs, payloads, auth — sample requests/responses\n\n",
