          "id": "10525",
          "body": "[@Kobi Kunasekaran](https://app.asana.com/1/1202721605677544/profile/1203115293332591)Here’s the walkthrough from Ryan who built our current Salesforce instance.\n\nFor some context, much of the development was done using Claude AI, with Ryan guiding the process. As a result, there are a number of implementation decisions and build patterns that don't necessarily align with how we would want to architect the solution moving forward..\n\nHave a look through it, and then let's connect with Lina and Joyce to discuss. At this stage, the main objective is for you to understand how the current environment was built and the logic behind it so you have that context as we think about the future-state design. [https://app.fireflies.ai/view/recording::01KVGHA7FCDPHKRJQRSZJV332K](https://app.fireflies.ai/view/recording::01KVGHA7FCDPHKRJQRSZJV332K)",
